# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets into an image layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
logs
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test + E2E material is not needed to run the app.
**/tests
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.eslintcache

# Docs and agent contract are not runtime assets.
docs
AGENTS.md
README.md